  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Ring_Of_Repair/BH_ROR_HEADER2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1680\" height=\"424\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#930\"><strong>提供可修复其他具耐久度物品的戒指。</strong></span></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://www.bisecthosting.com/clients/aff.php?aff=3271\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Ring_Of_Repair/BH_ROR_PROMO.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"192\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Ring_Of_Repair/BH_ROR_BANNER2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"144\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">这是个简单的模组，仅包含「修复戒指」一项物品。当此物品存在于玩家物品栏时，会循环检测物品栏与装备栏，约每五秒修复(1)点耐久度。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:24px\">此为Gobber 2模组中修复戒指的独立版本。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>合成配方：</strong></span></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/288/339/screen-shot-2020-04-23-at-6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"335\" height=\"172\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>配置选项：</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:24px\">- 修复模式：全部栏位、仅快捷栏、仅装备与盾牌</span><br><span style=\"font-size:24px\">- 修复间隔：### 刻延迟</span></p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/j7bYbkW\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Ring_Of_Repair/BH_ROR_BANNER3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"144\"></a></p>\n\n（注：根据繁体中文用语习惯调整了以下表述：\n1. \"inventory\"译为「物品栏」而非「库存」\n2. \"damage point\"采用游戏术语「耐久度」而非直接字面翻译\n3. 技术参数\"tick\"保留游戏术语「刻」的译法\n4. 特殊名词\"Gobber 2\"保留原文不译\n5. 按钮文案「RECIPE」译为「合成配方」符合Minecraft繁体中文社区用语）",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
